## ===========================================================================
## Resolve the revision context before any document or work item search runs.
## Empty revision means HEAD/current. Project Baseline selection takes
## precedence because its base revision is the authoritative snapshot point.
## The selected revision applies to all documents represented by the Data Set.
##
## Collection scope carries per-document revisions from its Collection elements,
## so Project Baseline and Revision are intentionally ignored in that mode.
## ===========================================================================
